  "description": "HUKFIG crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C81 H74 Cl4 N39 O21 Tb6,10(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 5 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 4 O neighbors; Tb5 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb6 (Tb) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 4.101-4.187 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 108.41-120.18°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C81H74Cl4N39O21Tb6·10H2O. Article name explicitly identifies I(II).",
